Package: batchieR
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Latent Factor Models for Combination Screens
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Teo", "Sakel",
      email = "teo@intelligentbiodata.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits Bayesian latent factor models to combination-response
    screens. The model captures context-specific treatment effects and
    interactions while supporting covariate-informed means, structured priors,
    hierarchical dose relationships, and configurable shrinkage. The approach
    is inspired by the BATCHIE method described by Platt et al. (2024)
    <doi:10.1038/s41467-024-55287-7>.
